== Documented changes ==
=== Changes ===
* The game now directly saves to the synchronized Steam Cloud folder.

=== Fixes ===
* Fixed an issue where the Sony DS4 controller was disconnected randomly when using both analogue sticks at the same time.

== Undocumented changes ==
=== Changes ===
* Limited {{i|Halo of Flies}} count to 10.
* Changed {{i|Lil Brimstone}} deal to 2 hearts
* Changed [[Ticking Spider]] collision damage to half a heart.
* Changed {{i|Head of Krampus}} to 6 charges.
* Improved {{i|Dark Bum}} mechanics.

=== Fixes ===
* Improved Steam Cloud sync.
* Fixed random disconnect for Sony controllers.
* Fixed crash on [[trinket]] pool reset
* Fixed {{i|Gemini}} + {{i|BFFS!}} synergy.
* Fixed {{i|Technology 2}} + {{i|Chocolate Milk}} synergy.
* [[Eden]]'s start items are seeded more reliably.
* Fixed collectible spawn position for {{i|There's Options}} and {{i|The Negative}}.
* Fixed {{i|Holy Mantle}} continue exploit.
* Fixed seed exploit for [[challenge|challenge runs]].
* Fixed [[hard mode]] affecting room drops other than hearts.
* Fixed P2 blood donation exploit.
* Fixed P2 {{i|Anti-Gravity}}.
* Fixed P2 being able to use [[bomb]]s.
* Fixed Devil deal exploit with half soul heart.
* Fixed invincible [[Carrion Queen]].
* Fixed [[??? (Character)|???]] restart issue.
* Fixed [[The Haunt]] not invincible for the first few frames.
* Fixed 60fps interpolation for {{i|Cube of Meat}} 2.
* Fixed picked up item disappearing when exiting during pickup animation.

